  "name": "crates_io_api",
  "description": "A Rust-native client library providing a comprehensive interface to the crates.io package registry API. It implements dual synchronous and asynchronous client architectures, the latter leveraging legacy futures 0.1 and tokio 0.1 via reqwest, to facilitate structured retrieval of crate metadata, dependency graphs, and download statistics. The project utilizes strongly-typed domain models for robust deserialization of registry responses.",
